{"id":"h266-03","codec":"h266","topic":"inverse-transform-implementation","task_type":"source_code","split_group":"vtm-inverse-transform-family","prompt":"固定 VTM 快照中，TrQuant::invTransformNxN 的主要调用顺序可简化为：先 xDeQuant；SPS 的 getUseLFNST() 为真时调用 xInvLfnst；随后 mtsIdx[compID]==SKIP 走 xITransformSkip，否则走 xIT。解释这段代码的顺序。能否据此断言所有 transform skip 块都不反量化，或所有启用 LFNST 的序列中每块都实际执行 LFNST？","evidence":[{"source_id":"vtm-code","source_revision":"010584cf75dd0b61bd6295d7eacf20975094aac4","locator":{"type":"file_lines","path":"source/Lib/CommonLib/TrQuant.cpp","start":546,"end":573},"snippet_sha256":"d4629e0bfc8ee8075d5575504ad305ec7d2779f3dfd9d65381bb2fac83323671"}]}
